# Testing

- **Runner**: Use pytest. Config in [config/pytest.ini](config/pytest.ini).
- **Markers**: Use markers (unit, cli, isolated, slow) for test organization. Run `make test-unit`, `make test-cli`, `make test-isolated`, `make test-fast` as appropriate.
- **Coverage**: Config in [config/coverage.ini](config/coverage.ini). Run `make test-coverage` for reports.
- **Paths**: Tests live under `tests/`; source under `src/`. `pythonpath = src/` in pytest.ini.
